{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34173","headline":"奉和袭美太湖诗二十首 太湖石 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美太湖诗二十首 太湖石","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"他山岂无石，厥状皆可荐。\n端然遇良工，坐使天质变。\n或裁基栋宇，礧砢成广殿。\n或剖出温瑜，精光具华瑱。\n或将破仇敌，百礮资苦战。\n或用镜功名，万古如会面。\n今之洞庭者，一以非此选。\n槎牙真不才，反作天下彦。\n所奇者嵌崆，所尚者葱蒨。\n旁穿参洞穴，内窍均环钏。\n刻削九琳窗，玲珑五明扇。\n新雕碧霞段，旋破秋天片。\n无力置池塘，临风只流眄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34173.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34173","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}